        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen, gaseous, 25 bar, from electrolysis, from label-certified electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen, gaseous, 25 bar, from electrolysis, from label-certified electricity
 Hydrogen production by electrolysis. Output pressure of 25 bar. The electricity mix to operate the electrolyzer can be adapted. Assumed 58 kWh/kg H2. Original source: X. Zhang, C. Bauer, C.L. Mutel, K. Volkart, Life Cycle Assessment of Power-to-Gas: Approaches, system variations and their environmental implications, Appl Energy, 190 (2017), pp. 326-338, 10.1016/j.apenergy.2016.12.098. UUID: 47b70b94-f94d-3f2d-9a3e-0d65ef735e2c
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Hydrogen production by electrolysis. Output pressure of 25 bar. The electricity mix to operate the electrolyzer can be adapted. Assumed 58 kWh/kg H2. Original source: X. Zhang, C. Bauer, C.L. Mutel, K. Volkart, Life Cycle Assessment of Power-to-Gas: Approaches, system variations and their environmental implications, Appl Energy, 190 (2017), pp. 326-338, 10.1016/j.apenergy.2016.12.098
Time period: Base technology year of 2020
Production volume: Unspecified
Sampling: Unspecified
Extrapolations: Unspecified
Uncertainty adjustments: Unspecified
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_47b70b94-f94d-3f2d-9a3e-0d65ef735e2c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
